+  - `security-hygiene`: hardcoded secrets, string-built SQL, missing input validation, permissive auth, weak crypto
+  - `documentation-drift`: docs or comments that contradict the code, public APIs without docstrings
+  - `correctness`: the code behaves wrongly (wrong result, broken contract, crash)
